DTRACE COVERAGE: FOURTEENTH EXPANSION
====================================

20 operation-focused passes in base software: 48 new USDT contracts across
17 binaries, with eight base-install bsdinstruments profiles. The four
extended-attribute commands are separate passes sharing the rmextattr binary.
This round adds userland observations that complement earlier kernel probes;
it does not add kernel probes or claim exhaustive system coverage.

